WEBVTT

01:36.670 --> 01:39.960
[NORTHWARD]

01:40.120 --> 01:41.990
[Episode 38]

01:45.729 --> 01:47.280
I think we can

01:47.280 --> 01:48.400
plant vegetables

01:48.400 --> 01:49.780
or something like that here.

01:49.800 --> 01:51.070
Plant vegetables? It's a garden.

01:51.070 --> 01:53.150
And raise some ducks and chickens.

01:53.150 --> 01:55.070
It can be lively here.

01:55.090 --> 01:55.840
Right?

01:56.000 --> 01:58.789
You'll ruin the environment if you build a vegetable garden.

01:59.930 --> 02:00.990
Look.

02:01.640 --> 02:03.950
I think if we're going to make a vegetable garden...

02:03.980 --> 02:04.980
Haihong!

02:05.970 --> 02:07.070
Where are you going?

02:09.800 --> 02:10.560
Haihong!

02:10.630 --> 02:11.310
What?

02:11.310 --> 02:12.000
Haihong!

02:12.490 --> 02:13.170
Look!

02:13.820 --> 02:14.830
What should I be looking at?

02:19.170 --> 02:21.710
[The operation went well]

02:33.710 --> 02:34.450
All right. All right.

02:42.280 --> 02:43.270
Thank you.

02:43.310 --> 02:44.030
Thank you, Director.

02:44.120 --> 02:44.910
Don't worry.

02:45.000 --> 02:46.560
I'll come here every day.

02:46.680 --> 02:48.150
Okay, thank you.

04:40.430 --> 04:41.240
You've passed.

04:50.120 --> 04:52.040
I'm not the youngest one.

04:52.040 --> 04:53.000
Come and try it.

04:53.040 --> 04:54.480
Try it. Come on.

04:54.480 --> 04:56.800
Today is a great day!

04:57.040 --> 04:59.120
Today, the Canal Bookstore

04:59.120 --> 05:00.630
built by our Flower Street residents

05:00.630 --> 05:01.740
is going to be opened!

05:04.720 --> 05:06.240
Come on, join us.

05:06.420 --> 05:07.360
I hereby announce

05:07.800 --> 05:09.300
that Canal Bookstore

05:09.830 --> 05:12.040
is now officially opened!

05:12.040 --> 05:12.720
Great!

05:12.580 --> 05:14.550
[Canal Bookstore]

05:20.530 --> 05:23.540
[Congratulations on the opening of the Canal Bookstore]

05:21.040 --> 05:22.270
Great! Great!

05:22.310 --> 05:24.680
Welcome to our bookstore.

05:24.720 --> 05:26.270
We're offering various promotions,

05:26.270 --> 05:28.000
as well as free snacks.

05:28.000 --> 05:28.430
Welcome.

05:28.430 --> 05:29.950
Welcome, welcome.

05:31.070 --> 05:31.740
Watch your step.

05:31.630 --> 05:35.360
[Congratulations on the opening of the Canal Bookstore]

05:32.070 --> 05:33.070
Watch your step.

05:35.540 --> 05:38.770
[Canal Bookstore]

05:38.040 --> 05:39.000
Please come in.

05:54.600 --> 05:56.440
Haikuo, all right, that should be enough.

05:56.500 --> 05:59.990
[Canal Bookstore]

05:56.600 --> 05:57.430
Go in now.

05:57.430 --> 05:57.870
Dad.

06:14.560 --> 06:15.480
You are...

06:18.160 --> 06:19.230
Long time no see.

06:30.200 --> 06:31.460
Yeah.

07:13.830 --> 07:14.600
Mom.

07:14.660 --> 07:15.920
Wait for me.

07:30.480 --> 07:31.780
Before I left,

07:31.800 --> 07:33.120
I begged the God of the Land

07:33.280 --> 07:34.390
to ask him to bless me.

07:35.159 --> 07:37.380
Otherwise, I wouldn't return the soil.

07:39.640 --> 07:40.840
Look at her.

07:41.270 --> 07:43.390
You even threatened the God of the Land.

07:44.600 --> 07:46.630
This is the rule Granny Ma taught me when I was little.

07:47.190 --> 07:48.870
She told me and Siyi when we were young.

07:50.040 --> 07:51.480
She said if we were weak,

07:51.480 --> 07:53.190
we should take some soil with us.

07:53.950 --> 07:55.040
It can replenish our energy.

07:56.270 --> 07:57.770
When we move,

07:58.040 --> 07:59.360
we should take all the soil away with us

08:00.040 --> 08:01.070
to let the God of the Land

08:01.390 --> 08:02.300
continue to bless us.

08:02.390 --> 08:04.040
Yes, bless us.

08:34.289 --> 08:35.669
Dad said you liked it.

08:36.480 --> 08:37.480
I just bought it.

08:38.600 --> 08:39.390
Drink it while it's hot.

08:43.390 --> 08:45.150
Are you still busy with the shipwreck?

08:47.870 --> 08:48.600
It goes well.

08:49.600 --> 08:52.360
I've found the origin of the families on the ship.

08:52.870 --> 08:53.630
It's such a coincidence.

08:54.600 --> 08:57.240
They were on the same ship 100 years ago.

08:57.510 --> 08:58.630
Now their descendants

08:58.630 --> 09:00.200
are living in the same courtyard,

09:00.480 --> 09:01.600
like a family.

09:05.720 --> 09:07.670
No wonder they don't want to be apart.

09:15.720 --> 09:16.360
Have a seat.

09:32.750 --> 09:33.540
It's good.

09:53.390 --> 09:55.320
Back then, you refused to listen to me

09:55.320 --> 09:56.910
and insisted on going to Honghuai Normal University.

09:58.840 --> 10:00.080
I was really sad.

10:03.240 --> 10:04.230
After graduation,

10:04.360 --> 10:05.790
you didn't want to work.

10:07.000 --> 10:07.980
You tell me yourself.

10:09.240 --> 10:11.030
Whose parents

10:11.510 --> 10:12.860
would like that

10:13.030 --> 10:15.030
to happen?

10:20.360 --> 10:22.390
Seeing you idle around all day,

10:23.910 --> 10:25.390
I felt more anxious than anyone else.

10:27.670 --> 10:29.080
You are my son.

10:30.150 --> 10:31.790
But I couldn't do anything about it.

10:33.270 --> 10:34.670
My words didn't work.

10:35.870 --> 10:37.360
I couldn't change your mind at all.

10:41.270 --> 10:42.390
Your dad always talked to me

10:44.270 --> 10:46.510
to make me believe what you did is meaningful.

10:49.360 --> 10:50.510
He said I didn't believe you.

10:54.550 --> 10:55.670
You proved that

10:57.030 --> 11:00.000
what your dad said is right

11:01.000 --> 11:02.150
with your persistence.

11:04.910 --> 11:06.840
The history of families along the canal

11:08.390 --> 11:10.320
has been ignored.

11:12.630 --> 11:13.510
You have studied it

11:14.790 --> 11:16.480
on your own

11:17.000 --> 11:18.510
for so long.

11:20.360 --> 11:22.440
I know it's not easy.

11:27.670 --> 11:29.270
You suffered a lot.

11:30.630 --> 11:32.510
You felt wronged.

11:36.530 --> 11:38.170
I admire you from the bottom of my heart.

11:42.150 --> 11:43.790
And I'm proud of you.

11:48.870 --> 11:49.550
All right.

11:51.750 --> 11:53.440
I just gave you a couple of compliments.

11:54.390 --> 11:55.790
Are you that easy to be so moved?

12:04.510 --> 12:05.180
All right.

12:05.510 --> 12:06.750
I know.

12:10.670 --> 12:11.840
I know.

12:14.630 --> 12:15.510
I know.

12:25.960 --> 12:29.830
[Opening Ceremony of the Flower Street Folk Culture Museum]

12:26.670 --> 12:27.340
Now,

12:27.390 --> 12:28.510
the opening ceremony

12:28.510 --> 12:29.790
officially begins!

12:31.150 --> 12:33.560
Let's welcome Mayor Gu to address us.

12:33.680 --> 12:34.770
Let's applaud!

12:45.390 --> 12:46.750
Dear fellow citizens,

12:46.750 --> 12:47.910
good day.

12:47.540 --> 12:53.070
[Opening Ceremony of the Flower Street Folk Culture Museum]

12:47.910 --> 12:48.750
Today,

12:49.030 --> 12:50.360
the Flower Street Folk Culture Museum

12:50.360 --> 12:53.510
has officially opened.

12:54.270 --> 12:56.460
Since the successful application for World Heritage status,

12:56.540 --> 12:58.530
more and more citizens

12:58.630 --> 13:00.700
have paid attention to the history,

13:00.750 --> 13:02.480
culture, and customs of Flower Street.

13:02.750 --> 13:05.630
That makes a venue where

13:05.750 --> 13:08.930
Flower Street's culture, history, and customs can be showcased

13:09.150 --> 13:10.980
particularly important.

13:12.510 --> 13:13.790
With the unremitting endeavor

13:13.910 --> 13:17.710
made by our young Curator Chen Rui,

13:17.980 --> 13:18.720
today,

13:18.750 --> 13:19.790
the museum

13:19.810 --> 13:21.220
has finally opened.

13:22.820 --> 13:26.280
[Opening Ceremony of the Flower Street Folk Culture Museum]

13:23.390 --> 13:26.240
Now, Curator Chen, please say something.

13:26.550 --> 13:27.080
Chen Rui!

13:27.100 --> 13:27.750
Chen Rui!

13:28.080 --> 13:28.870
I'll skip it, Dad.

13:28.870 --> 13:29.910
There are so many senior figures here.

13:29.910 --> 13:30.240
Chen Rui!

13:30.240 --> 13:32.270
It's an important day. Just go and say something.

13:32.270 --> 13:33.030
Chen Rui!

13:33.050 --> 13:33.730
Chen Rui!

13:33.760 --> 13:34.630
Chen Rui!

13:36.030 --> 13:36.630
Great!

13:38.030 --> 13:38.750
Great!

13:45.970 --> 13:46.780
Hello, everyone.

13:47.010 --> 13:47.950
I'm Chen Rui.

13:52.110 --> 13:55.490
I know I'm too young

13:55.550 --> 13:58.160
to be a curator at my age.

13:58.390 --> 13:59.670
But I promise

13:59.670 --> 14:02.120
my feelings for Flower Street are real.

14:03.150 --> 14:04.120
In the future,

14:04.240 --> 14:05.030
I'll...

14:06.700 --> 14:10.280
[Opening Ceremony of the Flower Street Folk Culture Museum]

14:35.230 --> 14:36.340
Siyi.

14:37.010 --> 14:39.820
At first, we heard that you went to Italy.

14:39.870 --> 14:42.160
We thought we'd never find you again.

14:43.030 --> 14:44.480
But Chen Rui

14:44.480 --> 14:45.720
never gave up.

14:45.870 --> 14:47.150
Now you are being shy.

14:47.150 --> 14:48.200
How did you force me back then?

14:48.240 --> 14:49.160
You asked me to...

14:49.710 --> 14:50.520
The man of great credit.

14:52.440 --> 14:54.360
Mayor Gu contacted me, saying

14:54.390 --> 14:56.030
after the canal's successful application for inscription on the World Heritage List,

14:56.030 --> 14:56.960
Flower Street will be renovated.

14:57.030 --> 14:58.510
She asked me to come back if I was available.

14:58.620 --> 15:00.650
Like you won't come back if Auntie Gu doesn't ask you.

15:01.810 --> 15:03.840
Do you know how much we miss you every year?

15:04.270 --> 15:05.630
Every New Year, we bet

15:05.670 --> 15:07.200
Siyi would come back this year,

15:07.270 --> 15:07.960
but every year...

15:08.000 --> 15:08.680
You lost the bet.

15:11.000 --> 15:11.550
Enough. Enough.

15:11.550 --> 15:12.240
Now,

15:12.270 --> 15:13.510
she's right sitting here.

15:13.510 --> 15:14.910
That's good, right?

15:15.000 --> 15:16.670
It's good that she's back.

15:16.670 --> 15:17.570
Siyi,

15:17.750 --> 15:19.380
you're not leaving

15:19.510 --> 15:20.360
this time, right?

15:22.050 --> 15:23.240
I haven't thought

15:23.240 --> 15:24.710
about the future.

15:24.790 --> 15:25.630
I've focused on what happened before

15:25.750 --> 15:27.440
all these years.

15:28.030 --> 15:30.140
Ever since I left Flower Street,

15:30.270 --> 15:31.240
I've asked around

15:31.360 --> 15:32.360
on my trip.

15:32.630 --> 15:35.240
Now the truth has finally come to light.

15:35.850 --> 15:37.970
My ancestors did have something to do with Little Polo.

15:39.720 --> 15:41.350
They were Italians

15:41.910 --> 15:42.840
from the Dimarks.

15:42.910 --> 15:44.320
They lived in Verona, Italy,

15:44.390 --> 15:46.410
a city near Venice.

15:46.630 --> 15:47.670
My great-great-grandfather's name

15:47.670 --> 15:49.340
is Fidel Dimark.

15:50.000 --> 15:52.510
To trace Marco Polo,

15:52.630 --> 15:55.240
he traveled thousands of miles to come to China

15:55.240 --> 15:57.660
with a business firm engaged in the porcelain trade.

15:58.840 --> 16:00.270
When he was in China,

16:00.270 --> 16:02.550
he wrote many letters to his family in Italy.

16:02.750 --> 16:04.150
The letter recorded

16:04.150 --> 16:05.840
his life in China in detail.

16:06.270 --> 16:07.960
In Beijing and Tianjin,

16:08.150 --> 16:10.370
he witnessed the suffering of China back then.

16:10.390 --> 16:11.750
The cruelty of war

16:11.750 --> 16:13.960
made him suffer and fear.

16:14.390 --> 16:15.510
He tried to return to Italy,

16:15.670 --> 16:17.510
but failed to buy a ship ticket.

16:17.960 --> 16:19.490
During his flight for life,

16:19.600 --> 16:21.640
he didn't give up writing to his family.

16:21.720 --> 16:22.840
But because of the war,

16:22.840 --> 16:24.220
all the letters were mailed back.

16:24.440 --> 16:25.390
At that time,

16:25.390 --> 16:27.360
he had a Chinese name,

16:27.440 --> 16:28.480
called Marford.

16:28.480 --> 16:30.150
He also married a Chinese girl,

16:30.150 --> 16:31.890
called Qin Ruyu.

16:32.000 --> 16:33.360
Their children

16:33.480 --> 16:34.890
is my great-grandfather.

16:35.080 --> 16:37.320
The last letter mailed to home from Marford

16:37.390 --> 16:38.440
caused his brother,

16:38.480 --> 16:40.220
Paul Dimark, concern.

16:40.360 --> 16:42.030
So they decided to go to China

16:42.030 --> 16:43.200
to look for their younger brother.

16:43.550 --> 16:45.630
This person is

16:45.670 --> 16:46.550
Little Polo everyone has talked about.

16:46.550 --> 16:47.250
Look.

16:47.380 --> 16:48.890
It's the one your grandpa talked about.

16:49.390 --> 16:51.510
Later, we found there were four people

16:51.510 --> 16:52.270
on the ship of Little Polo:

16:52.330 --> 16:53.790
Translator Xie Pingyao,

16:54.240 --> 16:56.090
Porter Shao Changlai,

16:56.270 --> 16:57.730
Ship Boss Xia...

16:58.570 --> 16:59.480
Boss!

16:59.550 --> 17:00.510
I'm the boss!

17:00.510 --> 17:01.550
And his disciple,

17:01.870 --> 17:02.510
Zhou Yiyan.

17:02.720 --> 17:03.420
He's here.

17:04.660 --> 17:05.210
Boss.

17:05.240 --> 17:06.829
Boss, here, here, let me toast you.

17:07.270 --> 17:08.980
Now, the boss has changed.

17:09.160 --> 17:09.720
Really.

17:14.480 --> 17:16.380
Xie Pingyao was a translator.

17:16.550 --> 17:18.410
He was entrusted by his best friend

17:18.589 --> 17:21.300
to go north with a foreigner.

17:21.660 --> 17:22.869
This foreigner

17:22.890 --> 17:25.000
was Paul Dimark.

17:25.310 --> 17:28.310
He preferred people to call him Little Polo.

17:29.440 --> 17:30.610
At first,

17:30.790 --> 17:33.960
he only said he was a canal expert

17:33.960 --> 17:35.790
who came all the way to China because of Marco Polo

17:35.790 --> 17:38.400
to inspect the Grand Canal.

17:38.790 --> 17:40.030
Along with him

17:40.030 --> 17:41.440
were Shao Changlai,

17:41.440 --> 17:43.720
the porter he hired in Hangzhou,

17:44.000 --> 17:46.590
Xia, the shipman he met in Suzhou,

17:46.920 --> 17:48.480
and Xia's disciple and the sailor,

17:48.720 --> 17:50.920
Zhou Yiyan.

17:51.510 --> 17:52.640
On their way north,

17:52.640 --> 17:54.070
Little Polo saw

17:54.680 --> 17:57.920
China experiencing a huge change.

17:58.550 --> 18:00.070
With the soul-capturing cannon he brought,

18:00.070 --> 18:02.070
now called camera,

18:02.590 --> 18:03.960
he photographed various Chinese people

18:03.960 --> 18:06.030
in his mind.

18:06.440 --> 18:08.030
Every scenery

18:08.030 --> 18:09.510
and every dock

18:09.510 --> 18:11.030
were a new experience

18:11.030 --> 18:13.160
to Little Polo.

18:14.680 --> 18:15.350
Soon,

18:15.750 --> 18:17.510
Xia's disciple Zhou Yiyan

18:17.510 --> 18:20.400
was very interested in Italian.

18:20.720 --> 18:23.350
He studied the foreign book Little Polo brought.

18:24.680 --> 18:25.550
He thought

18:25.720 --> 18:27.240
as long as he mastered English,

18:27.440 --> 18:28.790
his descendants

18:29.270 --> 18:31.440
can possibly become translators as well

18:31.790 --> 18:34.000
and lead a carefree life

18:34.000 --> 18:35.790
for generations.

18:38.270 --> 18:39.790
When staying away from the shore,

18:39.790 --> 18:42.350
they sailed and cooked.

18:42.350 --> 18:44.270
All they talked about were daily necessities.

18:45.880 --> 18:47.590
When Little Polo had nothing to do,

18:47.750 --> 18:50.070
he liked to sit on the board of the ship,

18:50.550 --> 18:52.080
getting to feel the breeze while drinking some tea

18:52.160 --> 18:53.350
with a square table

18:53.350 --> 18:54.880
and a bamboo chair,

18:55.550 --> 18:58.720
reading the Poetry Collection in the Year of Jihai in a desultory way,

18:59.270 --> 19:02.070
or teaching Zhou Yiyan Italian.

19:02.640 --> 19:05.270
He wrote his diary every day.

19:06.310 --> 19:08.550
They traveled together for days

19:09.070 --> 19:11.350
and established sufficient trust

19:11.350 --> 19:13.590
and extraordinary friendship.

19:18.240 --> 19:19.240
One night,

19:19.680 --> 19:21.630
the ship stopped at the shore.

19:21.660 --> 19:24.120
A few bandits got on the ship in the dark.

19:24.140 --> 19:25.730
They wanted to rob them of their property.

19:26.830 --> 19:29.780
When one of them took Little Polo's cane,

19:30.090 --> 19:32.200
Little Polo suddenly stood up resisting him

19:32.220 --> 19:33.520
and tried to get it back.

19:34.460 --> 19:35.720
They had a fierce fight

19:35.720 --> 19:37.550
with the bandits.

19:45.280 --> 19:48.190
Little Polo was injured and he was bleeding non-stop.

19:49.380 --> 19:50.780
Everyone had no choice

19:50.990 --> 19:53.100
but to take him and run away without taking the ship back.

19:53.850 --> 19:55.260
When they turned around,

19:55.510 --> 19:58.330
the huge ship that traveled with them along the way

19:58.400 --> 20:00.780
had already sunk to the bottom of the river

20:00.830 --> 20:02.510
amidst the raging flames.

20:04.310 --> 20:06.790
Little Polo's injury gradually deteriorated.

20:07.110 --> 20:08.660
He told Xie Pingyao

20:08.960 --> 20:11.480
that he cherished

20:11.480 --> 20:14.010
the cane he always carried

20:14.310 --> 20:16.350
because the last letter

20:16.350 --> 20:18.260
that his little brother wrote to him was in it.

20:18.850 --> 20:22.300
He came to China

20:22.320 --> 20:24.240
just to find his little brother,

20:24.270 --> 20:26.900
Fidel Dimark,

20:26.920 --> 20:28.590
also called Marford.

20:34.730 --> 20:35.960
Soon,

20:36.220 --> 20:38.180
at the last stage of his life,

20:39.110 --> 20:40.830
Little Polo admitted

20:41.050 --> 20:43.920
that he had fallen in love with this canal.

20:44.590 --> 20:46.260
He distributed his belongings

20:46.280 --> 20:49.670
to his traveling companies.

20:51.790 --> 20:54.480
On August 4, 1901,

20:55.010 --> 20:57.790
the Italian man Paul Dimark died.

20:59.110 --> 21:00.550
That tomb

21:00.550 --> 21:02.070
stuck with a cross

21:02.650 --> 21:05.220
facing the vast canal

21:06.030 --> 21:07.200
is just like Little Polo

21:07.200 --> 21:09.590
still sitting in the mud

21:10.110 --> 21:11.880
and enjoying Chinese tea,

21:12.070 --> 21:14.360
while getting to feel the breeze from the canal.

21:15.570 --> 21:16.910
More than 100 years later,

21:17.530 --> 21:19.850
the descendants of the four families on the ship

21:19.870 --> 21:21.390
and Marford's descendants

21:21.420 --> 21:24.420
met in the courtyard on Flower Street.

21:25.250 --> 21:27.150
Maybe, it's fate.

21:27.180 --> 21:29.460
The canal led them

21:29.480 --> 21:31.130
to reunite.

21:32.590 --> 21:35.270
The path that stretches for thousands of miles still exists,

21:35.460 --> 21:38.150
[By the Canal]

21:35.660 --> 21:38.700
while people come and go over a decade.

21:39.650 --> 21:42.040
Little Polo couldn't find Marford.

21:42.240 --> 21:44.440
The descendants of Little Polo's friends

21:44.230 --> 21:46.870
[By the Canal]

21:44.460 --> 21:47.660
found Marford's descendants

21:48.070 --> 21:50.200
under the mysterious arrangement of fate.

21:51.210 --> 21:54.450
The brothers who never had a chance to meet again

21:54.550 --> 21:57.910
[Flower Street]

21:54.640 --> 21:56.550
have got reunited

21:56.720 --> 22:00.330
in this way.

22:01.350 --> 22:02.130
Grandpa.

22:03.150 --> 22:03.680
Grandpa.

22:04.650 --> 22:05.260
Grandpa.

22:05.280 --> 22:06.860
Look who's back.

22:08.920 --> 22:09.730
Grandpa Zhou.

22:15.790 --> 22:17.070
Siyi, you're back.

22:18.680 --> 22:20.530
Why did the school get out so late today?

22:22.510 --> 22:25.640
You need to work harder for the college entrance exam next year.

22:25.640 --> 22:27.000
But don't push yourself.

22:27.930 --> 22:29.190
You're a smart girl.

22:29.400 --> 22:31.050
You can be admitted

22:31.080 --> 22:32.830
to any school you want.

22:33.610 --> 22:35.670
Don't listen to what your grandma said.

22:35.690 --> 22:37.310
Your grandma has never been educated.

22:36.170 --> 22:38.580
♫Far away, so far away♫

22:37.510 --> 22:40.040
She doesn't understand that taking a rest is as important as studying.

22:39.570 --> 22:42.890
♫The hometown I can never return to♫

22:40.350 --> 22:41.760
As for studies,

22:41.840 --> 22:43.440
you have to listen to me.

22:44.010 --> 22:46.440
♫Sitting quietly in the city♫

22:47.610 --> 22:51.760
♫Listening to the river flow♫

22:47.830 --> 22:48.590
Are you crying?

22:49.830 --> 22:50.790
What's wrong?

22:52.320 --> 22:53.780
Did you feel wronged in school?

22:55.660 --> 22:57.070
Who bullied you?

22:58.310 --> 23:01.740
♫Hometown, oh hometown♫

23:00.680 --> 23:02.050
Don't cry, don't cry, don't cry.

23:02.070 --> 23:02.990
Don't cry, don't cry, don't cry.

23:02.420 --> 23:05.900
♫Now a distant place I can't go back to♫

23:03.010 --> 23:04.350
Don't cry, don't cry, don't cry.

23:05.510 --> 23:07.590
I'll go find them at school tomorrow.

23:06.910 --> 23:09.500
♫Sitting quietly in the city♫

23:08.310 --> 23:09.070
All right, stop crying.

23:09.070 --> 23:10.400
Your grandma will suffer

23:10.320 --> 23:14.770
♫Listening as time drifts by♫

23:10.400 --> 23:11.580
if she sees you like this.

23:13.330 --> 23:14.640
Good girl. Don't cry.

23:14.640 --> 23:15.510
Don't cry.

23:17.530 --> 23:21.420
♫The sunsets in the city♫

23:21.820 --> 23:25.070
♫Hold no poetry, no distant dreams♫

23:26.510 --> 23:30.280
♫Walking through a world like a song♫

23:31.350 --> 23:35.100
♫From oblivion to oblivion♫

23:35.750 --> 23:39.280
♫The love that passed through those remaining years♫

23:40.160 --> 23:43.640
♫Without complaints or piano music♫

23:44.720 --> 23:48.160
♫The coolness after the gentle breeze♫

23:49.210 --> 23:53.540
♫I'm destined to be like you♫

24:02.030 --> 24:05.240
♫Far away, so far away♫

24:05.990 --> 24:09.360
♫The hometown I can never return to♫

24:10.610 --> 24:13.230
♫Sitting quietly in the city♫

24:13.640 --> 24:18.430
♫Listening to the river flow♫

24:39.480 --> 24:41.920
Look who's back!

24:42.510 --> 24:45.960
Where have you been these years?

25:02.790 --> 25:03.640
My name is Fenghua.

25:03.640 --> 25:04.590
What's your name?

25:05.160 --> 25:06.200
Ma Siyi.

25:06.640 --> 25:07.160
What?

25:07.180 --> 25:08.110
Louder, I can't hear you.

25:08.110 --> 25:09.720
Are you deaf? Her name is Ma Siyi.

25:09.830 --> 25:11.110
Let's go to school together,

25:11.110 --> 25:11.960
go home together,

25:12.070 --> 25:13.590
and do homework together at home.

25:14.610 --> 25:16.090
It's decided then?

25:19.540 --> 25:20.970
Let's go.

25:23.310 --> 25:24.440
Go to sleep.

25:25.480 --> 25:26.170
Siyi,

25:26.240 --> 25:26.750
go!

25:31.270 --> 25:33.710
When will you and Wanghe hold a wedding?

25:33.750 --> 25:35.320
I haven't decided yet.

25:35.480 --> 25:37.070
I need to get better first.

25:38.880 --> 25:39.930
You're not allowed to leave.

25:40.160 --> 25:42.030
This is the most important moment in my life.

25:42.030 --> 25:43.150
You must be there.

25:44.720 --> 25:45.790
It's said

25:46.510 --> 25:48.640
bridesmaids can't be prettier than the bride.

25:51.720 --> 25:52.920
Who is prettier?

25:52.920 --> 25:53.720
Speak honestly.

25:53.720 --> 25:54.880
It has to be you.

25:58.750 --> 25:59.550
Really?

25:59.550 --> 26:00.400
I'm telling you,

26:00.400 --> 26:01.550
don't bring your girlfriends back.

26:01.550 --> 26:03.190
Otherwise, I'll uncover your lie.

26:07.350 --> 26:08.110
What's wrong?

26:09.380 --> 26:10.250
Nothing.

26:10.680 --> 26:11.650
Put it on.

26:13.000 --> 26:13.790
I'm fine.

26:13.790 --> 26:15.060
Sit down and take a rest.

26:15.400 --> 26:16.740
Don't tire yourself out.

26:17.070 --> 26:18.940
You are so annoying.

26:20.790 --> 26:22.510
What is depicted in a poem written by Su Shi

26:22.510 --> 26:24.000
is just a perfect description of the relationship between Fenghua and Wanghe.

26:24.570 --> 26:26.630
"Suddenly I heard the fierce roar of my shrewish wife,

26:26.960 --> 26:28.920
and my walking stick dropped from my hand, leaving me in a state of bewilderment."

26:30.700 --> 26:31.920
Come on, Siyi, don't just stand there. Come on.

26:31.920 --> 26:32.400
Sit down, Siyi.

26:32.400 --> 26:33.200
Let's drink. Here.

26:34.200 --> 26:35.510
Come on.

26:35.510 --> 26:36.350
Let's drink. Come on.

26:36.440 --> 26:37.640
Not with him.

26:37.640 --> 26:38.750
What do you mean? Come on.

26:38.750 --> 26:39.270
Here.

26:40.000 --> 26:40.630
Cheers!

26:40.660 --> 26:41.400
Cheers!

26:41.400 --> 26:41.790
Come on. Come on.

26:41.790 --> 26:42.720
Although I'm toasting with a cup of water.

26:42.720 --> 26:43.600
Come on.

26:43.880 --> 26:44.480
Cheers. Cheers.

26:44.480 --> 26:45.870
Welcome home!

26:45.890 --> 26:46.720
Welcome home!

26:51.510 --> 26:52.030
Come on.

26:52.030 --> 26:52.750
Siyi, have some.

26:53.540 --> 26:54.310
It's freshly roasted.

26:54.310 --> 26:55.000
Suit yourself.

26:55.000 --> 26:55.790
Siyi.

26:55.880 --> 26:56.830
Try this. It's not spicy.

26:56.830 --> 26:57.590
Okay. Okay. Okay.

26:57.960 --> 26:59.480
I'll take my time.

26:59.790 --> 27:01.070
Are you not used to it?

27:01.070 --> 27:01.750
How about

27:01.750 --> 27:02.820
Xingchi cooking some dishes for you?

27:02.840 --> 27:03.730
Like pasta?

27:03.980 --> 27:05.240
Tell me what you want to eat.

27:05.750 --> 27:06.480
I can cook anything you want.

27:06.480 --> 27:07.880
When you were not back,

27:07.880 --> 27:09.310
I was the female lead.

27:09.310 --> 27:11.610
They were all focusing on me.

27:11.880 --> 27:14.300
Yet the moment you're back, I'm neglected.

27:14.440 --> 27:15.700
Why don't you leave?

27:15.790 --> 27:17.000
Where should I go?

27:17.000 --> 27:18.640
Have you left me a room in the new courtyard?

27:18.640 --> 27:19.240
Yes.

27:19.880 --> 27:21.150
You're still staying in the central hall.

27:21.440 --> 27:22.480
My grandpa told me

27:22.480 --> 27:24.110
to keep it for Granny Ma.

27:24.550 --> 27:25.480
And there must be

27:26.200 --> 27:28.810
an air conditioner

27:28.960 --> 27:30.340
and a new TV.

27:30.510 --> 27:32.310
Even the model was picked by my grandpa.

27:32.310 --> 27:33.440
Isn't the old man awesome?

27:33.440 --> 27:35.150
He could even pick a model when he has such a bad memory.

27:35.480 --> 27:36.270
He just remembers this.

27:42.480 --> 27:42.960
Be careful.

27:43.400 --> 27:43.830
I'm fine.

27:46.160 --> 27:47.610
All these years,

27:47.750 --> 27:48.960
I've bought postcards

27:48.960 --> 27:50.150
wherever I went.

27:50.440 --> 27:52.720
I didn't have the courage to send them back.

27:53.000 --> 27:54.860
So you can see a thick stack of postcards here.

27:55.900 --> 27:57.030
It's all

27:57.030 --> 27:58.270
I wanted to tell you back then.

27:58.550 --> 27:59.440
See for yourselves.

27:59.440 --> 28:00.740
Let me see. Let me see.

28:01.270 --> 28:02.030
Don't grab it.

28:02.030 --> 28:02.680
We all have the chance.

28:02.720 --> 28:03.480
Don't grab it.

28:06.000 --> 28:09.220
Our friendship is so deep while we're separated.

28:09.250 --> 28:10.490
Long time no see.

28:10.510 --> 28:12.140
The official account you made

28:12.270 --> 28:13.260
is great.

28:13.750 --> 28:14.900
I watched every issue.

28:15.200 --> 28:15.880
Really?

28:17.700 --> 28:20.760
I heard you have a lot of collections about the canal.

28:21.130 --> 28:22.920
Can you show me when it's available?

28:23.200 --> 28:23.920
Of course.

28:23.920 --> 28:24.720
Anytime.

28:24.740 --> 28:25.980
I'm waiting for you.

28:26.310 --> 28:27.030
Okay.

28:27.250 --> 28:28.220
Deal.

29:02.590 --> 29:04.440
You're still so charming on stage.

29:04.440 --> 29:06.360
But the rehearsal time is too short.

29:06.640 --> 29:08.270
If I had more time,

29:08.270 --> 29:09.590
I could have sung better.

29:11.200 --> 29:13.270
I finally understand what you said before.

29:13.370 --> 29:16.420
[To build a successful life, learning takes precedence, and at the core of learning lies reading]

29:14.830 --> 29:15.940
Stage

29:15.960 --> 29:16.910
is so important

29:17.310 --> 29:18.340
to you.

29:18.930 --> 29:20.070
Actually, over the years,

29:20.070 --> 29:21.820
I've been to many places.

29:22.950 --> 29:23.960
I didn't expect

29:24.850 --> 29:26.710
that I would be

29:27.570 --> 29:29.370
the happiest

29:29.500 --> 29:30.940
and most relaxed

29:31.190 --> 29:32.790
when I'm on this small stage.

29:32.960 --> 29:34.050
Well,

29:34.100 --> 29:35.420
according to what you said,

29:35.440 --> 29:36.650
you have to

29:36.980 --> 29:38.270
sing more here.

29:39.540 --> 29:40.930
Of course.

29:41.040 --> 29:42.780
I've promised Dad.

30:17.050 --> 30:17.930
He's here.

30:18.610 --> 30:19.300
Boss Xie!

30:19.330 --> 30:20.400
Boss Xie!

30:20.420 --> 30:21.170
Boss Xie!

30:22.250 --> 30:23.060
Boss Xie!

30:23.500 --> 30:24.710
Boss Xie, hurry!

30:24.730 --> 30:26.000
Your son is looking for you!

30:26.060 --> 30:26.960
Hurry!

30:27.120 --> 30:27.960
Boss Xie!

30:28.340 --> 30:29.670
What are you doing here?

30:29.720 --> 30:31.070
We've finally found you. Hurry!

30:32.710 --> 30:34.460
Your son has something to tell you.

30:36.070 --> 30:37.400
Hurry. Hurry.

30:37.910 --> 30:39.640
Lao'er, ask him to walk quickly.

30:40.310 --> 30:41.310
Boss Xie, we're waiting for you.

30:41.330 --> 30:42.640
Your son is looking for you.

30:42.670 --> 30:44.060
Look at this.

30:44.240 --> 30:46.940
Your son asked us to bring you here.

30:47.440 --> 30:48.640
So what do you bring me here

30:48.640 --> 30:49.810
for?

30:50.580 --> 30:51.120
Dad!

30:51.810 --> 30:53.390
Happy birthday!

30:52.570 --> 30:57.030
[Grand Canal]

30:54.550 --> 30:55.610
This cruise ship

30:56.140 --> 30:58.210
is your birthday present!

31:04.190 --> 31:05.500
Let me tell you, Wanghe.

31:05.520 --> 31:06.720
Don't joke around.

31:06.720 --> 31:08.670
Don't think I won't beat you up because you're married!

31:08.960 --> 31:10.030
Is it fun?

31:10.840 --> 31:11.500
What?

31:10.900 --> 31:14.040
[Grand Canal]

31:11.530 --> 31:12.250
Really!

31:12.280 --> 31:12.890
Really!

31:13.160 --> 31:14.240
What do you mean?

31:14.260 --> 31:15.810
It's really for you!

31:15.850 --> 31:16.960
I can also drive it.

31:18.470 --> 31:19.850
Hurry and come up!

31:19.960 --> 31:20.680
Come and have a look!

31:20.680 --> 31:22.160
This is his kindness. Hurry!

31:22.160 --> 31:23.880
Hurry. Let's take a look.

31:23.880 --> 31:25.640
Hurry. Hurry.

31:23.960 --> 31:28.900
[Grand Canal]

31:25.640 --> 31:25.920
Son.

31:25.920 --> 31:27.100
Go upstairs and have a look.

31:27.120 --> 31:28.080
This is...

31:28.200 --> 31:29.280
Hurry. Hurry.

31:29.310 --> 31:30.400
Don't make yourself fall.

31:30.550 --> 31:31.350
Dad.

31:31.610 --> 31:32.480
What's going on?

31:34.290 --> 31:35.170
How is it?

31:37.270 --> 31:38.310
This ship

31:38.590 --> 31:40.210
is not only for you

31:40.310 --> 31:42.530
but also for our whole courtyard.

31:42.880 --> 31:44.100
We used to

31:44.550 --> 31:45.750
buy a ship together before.

31:46.820 --> 31:47.480
When we sold it,

31:48.150 --> 31:49.240
you were not

31:49.260 --> 31:51.460
proud of us.

31:51.670 --> 31:52.480
Seems

31:52.510 --> 31:54.160
you were in a daze all the time.

31:56.120 --> 31:58.120
It's not that serious.

31:58.560 --> 32:00.410
I'm not... Not that fragile.

32:01.530 --> 32:02.140
Dad.

32:02.760 --> 32:04.130
Now that Flower Street

32:04.500 --> 32:05.810
has been included in the World Heritage List,

32:05.960 --> 32:07.400
it's going to embrace prosperous development.

32:07.620 --> 32:08.850
Mayor Gu said,

32:09.040 --> 32:10.780
we can start with the tourism industry.

32:10.880 --> 32:12.980
So we can use this ship

32:13.070 --> 32:14.060
to offer catering services,

32:14.160 --> 32:15.170
produce embroidered products,

32:15.270 --> 32:16.830
and perform

32:16.930 --> 32:18.460
small-scale shows.

32:19.820 --> 32:21.310
Let me show you around the cockpit.

32:21.330 --> 32:21.880
Let's go!

32:22.290 --> 32:23.580
Embroidery...

32:23.610 --> 32:25.030
We can just do it here.

32:26.180 --> 32:27.460
I just saw

32:27.480 --> 32:28.820
the sunset is beautiful outside.

32:28.920 --> 32:30.240
Let's go take some photos.

32:30.240 --> 32:31.070
Let's go.

32:31.070 --> 32:31.760
Let's go.

32:31.780 --> 32:32.920
Let's go.

32:41.140 --> 32:41.880
There...

32:43.020 --> 32:44.030
There...

32:44.200 --> 32:45.930
There are so many electronic devices.

32:45.950 --> 32:47.150
I'm not familiar with them.

32:47.180 --> 32:48.590
I've never... Never...

32:48.610 --> 32:49.730
I've never operated them.

32:49.750 --> 32:50.750
Just learn how to do it.

32:50.980 --> 32:52.110
The basic principles are the same.

32:52.140 --> 32:52.960
Take your time.

32:53.030 --> 32:55.000
You're so smart. You'll master it soon.

32:55.050 --> 32:56.150
You're right.

32:56.240 --> 32:57.550
Come on, sit down and feel it.

32:57.570 --> 32:58.340
Okay.

32:58.810 --> 33:00.200
It's different from your previous one.

33:00.240 --> 33:01.160
Of course.

33:02.750 --> 33:05.020
I can see far away by sitting here.

33:08.240 --> 33:08.970
You're holding it upside down.

33:09.550 --> 33:10.450
Yes.

33:13.950 --> 33:15.210
Interesting.

33:15.910 --> 33:17.300
So interesting!

33:18.780 --> 33:22.520
One, two, three!

33:23.480 --> 33:26.150
[Six months later]

33:25.030 --> 33:26.280
Let's go. Let's go.

33:26.480 --> 33:27.750
I saw it when I was young.

33:27.750 --> 33:29.000
It can be traced back to the Qing Dynasty.

33:29.000 --> 33:30.060
It's my dad's precious thing.

33:31.510 --> 33:32.920
You guys,

33:33.130 --> 33:34.410
come up and have a rest.

33:35.390 --> 33:36.740
Let's go up and take a rest.

33:37.790 --> 33:38.750
Are you tired?

33:39.110 --> 33:40.340
Have some soft drink.

33:41.150 --> 33:41.880
You should drink it.

33:41.880 --> 33:42.440
Thanks, but no.

33:42.440 --> 33:42.750
Chen Rui,

33:42.750 --> 33:43.630
let me give you a massage.

33:45.230 --> 33:46.510
You must be exhausted.

33:49.750 --> 33:51.030
Let me give you a massage.

33:52.240 --> 33:53.000
Go away.

33:53.030 --> 33:55.610
The central hall of the new courtyard seems much bigger than this.

33:55.640 --> 33:56.870
It's much higher.

33:56.890 --> 33:58.320
Yes, we demolished and rebuilt it.

33:58.350 --> 33:59.580
The foundation has also been reinforced.

34:00.000 --> 34:01.500
If you have any opinions,

34:01.550 --> 34:03.030
remember to tell us in advance.

34:03.030 --> 34:04.920
Or it'll be too late to make any changes after we move in.

34:05.830 --> 34:06.960
I don't have any opinions.

34:08.480 --> 34:09.080
What about you?

34:17.139 --> 34:18.199
Me?

34:18.570 --> 34:19.630
Why?

34:19.710 --> 34:20.780
You don't want to live in the courtyard?

34:20.920 --> 34:21.590
Fine.

34:21.610 --> 34:23.170
If you don't, I'll stay with Siyi.

34:23.199 --> 34:25.030
You can sleep in your museum as you want.

34:25.060 --> 34:25.870
What happened?

34:25.889 --> 34:26.679
When did that happen?

34:26.710 --> 34:27.550
Why would Siyi

34:27.550 --> 34:29.030
be willing to be with you?

34:29.030 --> 34:30.230
What did you do behind our backs?

34:30.230 --> 34:31.400
I'll give you a rear naked choke!

34:31.400 --> 34:31.960
Shameless!

34:31.960 --> 34:32.710
I'll give you a rear naked choke!

34:32.710 --> 34:33.710
Shameless!

34:33.710 --> 34:34.480
I'll give you a rear naked choke!

34:34.480 --> 34:35.710
Shameless!

34:35.710 --> 34:36.480
Show us the evidence!

34:36.480 --> 34:37.230
Enough! Enough!

34:37.230 --> 34:38.320
When was that?

34:38.320 --> 34:39.250
Stop it. Stop it.

34:39.400 --> 34:40.000
Be careful not to spill it.

34:40.000 --> 34:40.590
You should

34:40.590 --> 34:41.510
think about

34:41.510 --> 34:42.400
what you haven't done

34:42.400 --> 34:43.320
before you move in.

34:44.870 --> 34:45.880
I remember something.

34:45.880 --> 34:46.710
You guys continue.

34:48.880 --> 34:50.710
I remember Grandma once said,

34:50.710 --> 34:51.480
when she came here,

34:51.480 --> 34:53.480
she dug some soil from the dock of Linqing

34:55.030 --> 34:56.280
and sprinkled it

34:56.280 --> 34:57.550
under that tree.

35:00.760 --> 35:01.800
I want to take it away.

35:03.190 --> 35:03.920
Otherwise,

35:04.710 --> 35:05.840
Grandma will get lost.

35:13.240 --> 35:13.910
Turn around.

35:22.160 --> 35:24.000
We will be together

35:22.660 --> 35:26.240
♫Life is always too slow♫

35:24.000 --> 35:27.230
forever!

35:27.390 --> 35:30.840
♫The fallen leaves cover the whole pond as I move to a new home♫

35:29.140 --> 35:30.260
Where am I?

35:31.590 --> 35:34.130
You said it. Don't cheat.

35:31.840 --> 35:35.230
♫A twenty-inch color TV and a leather sofa♫

35:34.280 --> 35:36.080
I said it. I won't.

35:36.280 --> 35:39.730
♫Big Pinwheel animation at half past five♫

35:37.150 --> 35:38.340
What are you doing?

35:39.070 --> 35:40.230
I saw it.

35:40.480 --> 35:42.120
Everything has been recorded.

35:40.820 --> 35:44.410
♫Enjoy the cool night under the starry sky after dinner♫

35:42.630 --> 35:44.190
They are dating

35:44.210 --> 35:44.950
on the balcony.

35:45.160 --> 35:48.840
♫Fireflies, a gentle breeze, and a crescent moon♫

35:46.230 --> 35:47.440
Make sure to catch it all on camera.

35:47.550 --> 35:48.650
It'll serve as evidence in the future.

35:48.800 --> 35:49.620
What are you writing?

35:49.910 --> 35:53.480
♫Adults are chatting about things that I can't understand♫

35:51.280 --> 35:52.280
A meal ticket for life.

35:54.300 --> 35:58.000
♫Ghosts and monsters are all hiding under the bed♫

35:56.070 --> 35:56.880
Mr. Xu,

35:57.000 --> 35:59.000
you were the first to be heartless to Wanghe,

35:59.000 --> 36:01.070
so don't blame me and Haikuo for being unkind in return.

35:59.080 --> 36:02.600
♫We grow up day by day♫

36:03.400 --> 36:07.070
♫In my memory, the rain keeps pouring♫

36:07.360 --> 36:09.000
Who did it this time?

36:07.990 --> 36:11.480
♫The summer vacation is over amidst cicadas' chirping♫

36:09.000 --> 36:09.800
Who?

36:10.280 --> 36:11.400
It's too much!

36:12.310 --> 36:15.760
♫It's time to get a haircut again at the start of the new semester♫

36:12.510 --> 36:13.710
It's too much!

36:14.630 --> 36:15.320
Siyi,

36:16.190 --> 36:17.510
have you decided where to go?

36:17.030 --> 36:20.650
♫We grow up day by day♫

36:18.550 --> 36:20.360
What are you shooting? Can't you stop for a while?

36:20.880 --> 36:22.690
Stop laughing. Stop laughing.

36:21.530 --> 36:25.160
♫Starting to have expectations and changes♫

36:22.760 --> 36:24.190
Fenghua, your hair looks nice today.

36:24.190 --> 36:25.400
I look good every day.

36:25.400 --> 36:27.670
This is where we grew up together.

36:25.990 --> 36:29.520
♫Once we thought we were so great♫

36:28.400 --> 36:29.590
By the canal.

36:30.760 --> 36:34.230
♫I wrote poems but dared not to give them to her♫

36:35.160 --> 36:38.890
♫We grow up day by day♫

36:39.810 --> 36:43.340
♫While listening to tapes, we unexpectedly met under the banyan tree♫

36:44.300 --> 36:47.840
♫A white shirt, the evening twilight, and an acoustic guitar♫

36:48.780 --> 36:52.260
♫The innocent cheeks of youth♫

37:06.440 --> 37:07.150
Yanlin.

37:07.760 --> 37:08.620
Yanlin.

37:08.920 --> 37:11.030
I have a box containing porcelains.

37:11.030 --> 37:11.670
Put it gently when you take it.

37:11.670 --> 37:12.510
Be careful.

37:12.880 --> 37:13.510
Grandpa!

37:13.530 --> 37:14.320
Grandpa!

37:14.320 --> 37:15.760
Stop doing that.

37:15.760 --> 37:16.400
Go back to your room.

37:16.400 --> 37:17.840
We're moving these things out. Please be careful not to get bumped.

37:24.820 --> 37:25.430
Grandpa.

37:26.480 --> 37:27.190
Be careful.

37:30.010 --> 37:33.040
♫We thought we were great♫

37:32.000 --> 37:33.000
Move the sofa

37:33.000 --> 37:34.440
to the second car!

37:33.970 --> 37:37.420
♫I wrote poems but dared not to give them to her♫

37:34.440 --> 37:35.860
Don't make a mistake!

37:37.520 --> 37:38.650
Move?

37:38.800 --> 37:39.980
Where are we moving to?

37:41.450 --> 37:43.160
Didn't we just move here yesterday?

37:43.210 --> 37:46.650
♫I dared not to give them to her♫

37:46.510 --> 37:48.180
Why are you taking this?

37:48.210 --> 37:49.230
Wanghe doesn't need it now.

37:49.230 --> 37:51.110
What if our grandson needs it in the future?

37:51.280 --> 37:52.400
You're really...

37:52.550 --> 37:53.210
Good for you.

37:53.800 --> 37:55.000
Can you bear to hit your grandson?

37:55.000 --> 37:56.220
I can't anyway.

37:56.490 --> 37:57.550
Let's move to a new place.

37:57.760 --> 37:58.280
Boss Xie.

37:58.280 --> 37:59.330
Lao'er.

37:59.360 --> 38:01.000
What are you wearing?

38:01.000 --> 38:02.320
How come you're dressed in patterns that look just like those on playing cards?

38:02.320 --> 38:03.400
He bought it online.

38:03.400 --> 38:04.070
I couldn't stop him.

38:04.070 --> 38:05.110
I'm trying something new in my life.

38:05.110 --> 38:05.960
You...

38:05.960 --> 38:07.510
Why? Do you need a new wife too?

38:07.510 --> 38:08.780
You're such a naughty woman.

38:09.070 --> 38:10.320
You're so fashionable.

38:10.320 --> 38:11.430
You're out too?

38:12.670 --> 38:13.530
Everything's packed up?

38:13.800 --> 38:14.710
Yes.

38:17.790 --> 38:18.600
All right.

38:18.840 --> 38:19.510
Is it done?

38:19.510 --> 38:20.000
Done.

38:20.000 --> 38:20.840
Come on, let's go.

38:20.840 --> 38:22.000
Come on, let's go.

38:22.000 --> 38:23.280
It's okay. Take your things.

38:23.280 --> 38:24.070
Let's go.

38:24.070 --> 38:25.110
Take your stuff. Take your stuff.

38:28.540 --> 38:30.490
♫When the moon hangs in the sky♫

38:31.400 --> 38:33.040
♫And it's cooling in the yard♫

38:33.800 --> 38:37.180
♫Who is still by your side?♫

38:38.440 --> 38:41.880
♫As time passes♫

38:42.580 --> 38:46.020
♫Is a lifetime really that long?♫

38:47.410 --> 38:49.420
♫When youthful company fades♫

38:48.330 --> 38:49.120
Let's go.

38:49.400 --> 38:50.070
Let's go.

38:49.870 --> 38:51.940
♫Leaving only small talk and pleasantries♫

38:51.850 --> 38:52.650
Wait.

38:52.670 --> 38:54.420
Should we take a photo

38:52.690 --> 38:55.890
♫Spring feels short, while autumn lingers♫

38:54.450 --> 38:55.590
in this courtyard?

38:55.760 --> 38:56.400
Sure.

38:56.400 --> 38:57.070
Sure.

38:57.070 --> 38:58.800
Let's take a photo.

38:57.360 --> 39:00.760
♫A gentle breeze carries dreams away♫

38:58.800 --> 38:59.190
Come on.

38:59.190 --> 39:00.480
Let's stand here.

39:00.480 --> 39:01.630
Down here. Okay.

39:01.630 --> 39:02.190
Okay.

39:02.020 --> 39:05.640
♫Dreamland and dreams♫

39:02.190 --> 39:03.190
The tall ones stand behind.

39:03.630 --> 39:04.960
Lao'er, move forward.

39:04.960 --> 39:06.710
Mom, here.

39:06.710 --> 39:07.270
Mom.

39:07.670 --> 39:10.690
♫Life is long♫

39:10.550 --> 39:11.150
Young Master.

39:11.760 --> 39:12.190
Come on.

39:12.190 --> 39:12.920
Look at the camera.

39:12.390 --> 39:15.270
♫No need to dwell♫

39:12.920 --> 39:14.170
Are we within the frame?

39:16.920 --> 39:18.670
Three, two, one.

39:17.000 --> 39:20.040
♫Like moonlight♫

39:18.670 --> 39:20.510
Cheese!

39:21.510 --> 39:24.780
♫Don't forget♫

39:26.310 --> 39:29.490
♫Life is long♫

39:31.070 --> 39:34.460
♫No need to dwell♫

39:35.660 --> 39:38.730
♫Like moonlight♫

39:36.610 --> 39:41.840
[One year later]

39:40.400 --> 39:44.960
♫The old times♫

39:42.550 --> 39:43.320
Now,

39:43.320 --> 39:44.470
we're at Flower Street.

39:44.550 --> 39:46.800
We can see the couplets inscribed in both piers of the memorial archway:

39:46.800 --> 39:48.780
A thousand sails pass by the sunken boat;

39:46.870 --> 39:50.270
[Flower Street]

39:48.840 --> 39:50.920
After a hundred years, my heart has returned to tranquility.

39:50.460 --> 39:56.710
[I miss you so much at Flower Street]

39:51.400 --> 39:53.320
The pier

39:53.320 --> 39:54.550
and this bridge we're seeing now

39:54.570 --> 39:56.570
have over 400 years of history.

39:57.030 --> 39:59.260
The stone tablet in front of us

39:59.630 --> 40:01.150
was inscribed by

40:00.390 --> 40:06.570
[Yu Dock]

40:01.150 --> 40:03.920
Liu Yong, also known as Liu Luoguo, a renowned calligrapher

40:03.920 --> 40:04.880
during the reign of Emperor Qianlong in the Qing Dynasty.

40:05.190 --> 40:06.280
You can take a picture here.

40:06.670 --> 40:10.450
[I miss you so much at Flower Street]

40:08.030 --> 40:08.550
Hello?

40:09.000 --> 40:09.800
Got it.

40:09.800 --> 40:10.670
The wedding dress has just been altered.

40:10.670 --> 40:12.420
Who would've known she would gain so much weight?

40:13.000 --> 40:13.960
All right, stop rushing me.

40:13.960 --> 40:14.980
I'll be back soon.

40:17.480 --> 40:18.480
Mom! Mom!

40:18.480 --> 40:20.360
Why is this ship

40:20.360 --> 40:21.590
decorated

40:21.590 --> 40:24.380
like this?

40:24.940 --> 40:28.080
[Grand Canal]

40:25.590 --> 40:27.930
Because someone is getting married today, Sweetheart.

40:28.250 --> 40:29.070
The bride and groom

40:29.070 --> 40:31.610
grew up by the canal.

40:32.880 --> 40:33.760
In ancient times,

40:33.760 --> 40:34.550
getting married on a ship

40:34.960 --> 40:36.670
was a tradition for those living by the river.

40:37.890 --> 40:40.120
The bride is here!

40:41.240 --> 40:41.900
Young Master.

40:43.920 --> 40:45.310
Who will drive the ship today?

40:45.340 --> 40:46.620
My dad and your dad.

40:47.160 --> 40:48.110
Didn't you ask others for help?

40:48.110 --> 40:48.960
Yes.

40:49.170 --> 40:50.290
They are petty.

40:50.310 --> 40:51.580
They won't let anyone drive the ship.

40:51.800 --> 40:53.000
When they get drunk,

40:53.000 --> 40:54.450
I'll ask others for help.

40:54.550 --> 40:55.880
Don't worry. I've arranged everything.

40:55.880 --> 40:57.480
Ladies and gentlemen of Flower Street,

40:57.480 --> 40:59.000
welcome to

40:59.000 --> 41:00.400
the wedding today!

41:00.400 --> 41:03.110
Our cruise ship is ready!

41:03.110 --> 41:03.760
Yes!

41:03.780 --> 41:05.480
-Where do you want to go today?
-Look what he said.

41:05.480 --> 41:06.840
Who should decide the destination?

41:06.840 --> 41:07.800
The bride.

41:07.800 --> 41:08.920
Yes.

41:08.920 --> 41:10.360
The bride.

41:13.760 --> 41:16.000
When we were young, we saw you go through the ship lock

41:16.000 --> 41:17.440
on the shore.

41:17.460 --> 41:18.870
We are all curious

41:18.900 --> 41:21.340
about the world on the other side of the ship lock.

41:21.630 --> 41:24.600
Okay, let's go through the ship lock today.

41:24.630 --> 41:26.580
We won't stop after going through it.

41:26.620 --> 41:28.060
We'll keep going forward!

41:28.080 --> 41:29.210
Great!

41:29.230 --> 41:30.760
We'll reach beyond the sea.

41:31.140 --> 41:32.900
We'll keep going forward

41:33.000 --> 41:35.190
until we reach the Suez Canal!

41:37.400 --> 41:38.510
Ready to set sail.

41:54.000 --> 41:54.670
Flower Street!

41:55.030 --> 41:55.710
Flower Street.

41:56.040 --> 41:57.020
Look! Look!

41:57.170 --> 41:58.100
Master!

41:58.190 --> 41:59.230
By the Canal!

41:59.230 --> 42:00.710
Yes, right there.

42:00.710 --> 42:01.710
Can you see it?

42:17.750 --> 42:19.900
Fenghua, slow down!

42:35.300 --> 42:36.580
Xingchi!

42:36.850 --> 42:38.280
Run faster!

43:10.000 --> 43:12.800
Thank you for coming to the wedding of the groom Xie Wanghe

43:12.800 --> 43:15.360
and the bride Xia Fenghua.

43:15.540 --> 43:18.000
Now, please applaud

43:18.360 --> 43:22.280
to welcome the beautiful bride!

43:25.640 --> 43:27.830
♫Inexplicable and strange♫

43:27.890 --> 43:31.410
♫I can't both love you and let you go♫

43:32.120 --> 43:34.040
♫I want to say something but keep silent♫

43:34.260 --> 43:38.190
♫Just quietly listening to my heart thudding♫

43:37.630 --> 43:39.760
Okay. Bride and groom, please get ready.

43:39.550 --> 43:41.730
♫But you don't know♫

43:41.090 --> 43:42.440
Then I have a question

43:41.960 --> 43:46.430
♫When I turn around, my eyes water too♫

43:42.440 --> 43:44.190
for the bride and groom.

43:44.590 --> 43:46.060
The groom Xie Wanghe,

43:46.110 --> 43:49.670
will you marry the beautiful Miss Xia Fenghua,

43:46.730 --> 43:48.870
♫I was already giving my all♫

43:49.050 --> 43:52.610
♫To maintain a final bit of dignity♫

43:50.030 --> 43:52.240
whether in poverty or wealth,

43:52.510 --> 43:54.720
and never be separated from her?

43:53.600 --> 43:54.510
♫Fortunately♫

43:54.730 --> 43:57.090
♫You once gave me a warm hug♫

43:54.920 --> 43:55.880
Yes, I do.

43:55.880 --> 43:57.280
The bride Xia Fenghua,

43:57.140 --> 43:58.240
♫Unfortunately♫

43:58.540 --> 44:00.790
♫I can't have you, yet I still crave you♫

43:58.670 --> 44:01.550
will you marry the groom Xie Wanghe,

44:00.980 --> 44:01.880
♫How can I decide♫

44:01.880 --> 44:03.880
whether in poverty or wealth,

44:02.030 --> 44:03.620
♫Which is messier♫

44:03.640 --> 44:05.440
♫The beginning or the end?♫

44:04.280 --> 44:05.960
and never be separated from him?

44:05.620 --> 44:07.830
♫Both are unforgettable♫

44:07.230 --> 44:08.190
Yes, I do.

44:08.140 --> 44:09.520
♫Why does your kindness♫

44:09.540 --> 44:10.370
♫Vanish♫

44:10.400 --> 44:12.110
♫The moment I let go?♫

44:12.150 --> 44:12.800
Great!

44:12.460 --> 44:13.690
♫How could you leave me so heartbroken♫

44:13.830 --> 44:14.590
♫That even my tears♫

44:14.400 --> 44:16.070
Now,

44:14.840 --> 44:16.500
♫Feel like they're burning?♫

44:16.070 --> 44:17.710
we're going to proceed to the most important part.

44:16.600 --> 44:19.920
♫Maybe it's a relief that we're not meant for each other♫

44:18.630 --> 44:20.280
Should the bride and groom

44:20.130 --> 44:22.690
♫No need to suffer too long♫

44:20.280 --> 44:22.670
kiss each other in front of us?

44:22.670 --> 44:23.630
Yes! Yes!

44:22.820 --> 44:24.210
♫Why can you♫

44:24.230 --> 44:25.160
♫Forget my kindness♫

44:25.280 --> 44:26.870
♫The moment you let go?♫

44:25.590 --> 44:26.840
Kiss! Kiss!

44:27.080 --> 44:28.400
♫Making me look like a fool♫

44:28.550 --> 44:29.350
♫Even my longing♫

44:29.370 --> 44:31.110
♫Feels like begging♫

44:31.370 --> 44:33.450
♫I'll let go eventually♫

44:33.630 --> 44:37.530
♫I'll say goodbye and disturb you no more♫

44:44.860 --> 44:46.260
♫Why does your kindness♫

44:46.280 --> 44:47.170
♫Vanish♫

44:47.370 --> 44:48.890
♫The moment I let go?♫

44:49.160 --> 44:50.490
♫How could you leave me so heartbroken♫

44:50.680 --> 44:51.340
♫That even my tears♫

44:51.550 --> 44:53.140
♫Feel like they're burning?♫

44:53.690 --> 44:56.690
♫Maybe it's a relief that we're not meant for each other♫

44:57.010 --> 44:59.410
♫No need to suffer too long♫

44:58.480 --> 45:02.630
One, two, three. Cheese!

44:59.710 --> 45:00.960
♫Why can you♫

45:01.120 --> 45:01.840
♫Forget my kindness♫

45:02.050 --> 45:03.690
♫The moment you let go?♫

45:03.890 --> 45:05.230
♫Making me look like a fool♫

45:05.430 --> 45:06.150
♫Even my longing♫

45:06.290 --> 45:07.890
♫Feels like begging♫

45:08.100 --> 45:10.240
♫I'll let go eventually♫

45:08.110 --> 45:11.760
Congratulations on your wedding!

45:10.470 --> 45:14.330
♫I'll say goodbye and disturb you no more♫
